<title>UK: Turkey to buy 75,000 tonnes end-Oct gas oil - trade.</title>
<headline>Turkey to buy 75,000 tonnes end-Oct gas oil - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish state oil company Tupras has issued a purchase tender for 75,000 tonnes of gas oil for delivery by the end of October, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender, closing on Tuesday, requests three cargoes of 0.5 percent sulphur gas oil to be delivered into Izmit from October 14-25, they added. Tupras accepts bids based on a premium to fob benchmark quotes.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
